          "quote": "LD39200PU33R ... produces 3V3 for \"MCUs and Sensors\""
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The microcontrollers and the 3V3 pull-up/connector rail are not supplied, so the board cannot boot or operate normally.",
      "confidence": 0.96
    },
