        "unconnected-(NAVC1-PB6-Pad58)",
        "unconnected-(NAVC1-PB7-Pad59)"
      ],
      "observed": "The NAVC-side I2C, UART2 and GPIO nets contain sensors, pull-ups, test points and series link resistors, but they have no NAVC1 pin nodes. The corresponding NAVC1 GPIO/UART pins appear only in unconnected-(NAVC1-...) nets.",
      "expected": "STM32F405RGTx should be connected to the navigation sensor I2C bus and to the FCC through UART2, I2C and GPIO links.",
      "evidence": [
        {
